{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/migobanner.jpg?t=1745023078\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to YokaiKon, a brand-new Japanese pop culture convention offering the best programming in anime, video games, cosplay, and (of course) murder! After the death of a beautiful J-pop idol singer in a historic high rise hotel, Cleo the clue-sniffing dog and Detective Guy step into the strange underbelly of Japanese animation fandom. Could her killer be an obsessive stalker, a bitter rival, or a malignant spirit from ancient Japanese legend? Help our detective duo illuminate this dark and kowai mystery before the rising sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a spooky 1920s hotel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interview eccentric suspects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover crucial clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware the curse of the Oni Statue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unmask a killer mastermind</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/elevator.gif?t=1745023078\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/extras/ftn.gif?t=1745023078\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3485220?t=1745023078","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3485220?t=1745023078","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/af845bc6ff28afbabb0e9c8af190863cf8e6bfee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745023078","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485220/af845bc6ff